        "id": 127855,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-18T02:30:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Phantom5613\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/48/1906_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Phantom5613:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If you get \"Not all he seems\" Against WM first turn and you have a healer in your party(Like Omnitron-X with his innervation Ray), and WM deals everyone some form of damage on the first turn, winning on Round 2 is totally doable. Maybe not the fastest out of everyone's stories, but still pretty short.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Call me confused, but I cannot for the life of me figure out how this works.</p>",
